{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2021-11-18 11:15:00', 'title': "THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. TO ACCELERATE SMUCKER'S® UNCRUSTABLES® GROWTH THROUGH INVESTMENT IN NEW MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN MCCALLA, ALABAMA", 'text': "ORRVILLE, OHIO, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL INVEST $1.1 BILLION TO BUILD A NEW MANUFACTURING FACILITY AND DISTRIBUTION CENTER IN MCCALLA, ALABAMA, DEDICATED TO PRODUCTION OF SMUCKER'S® UNCRUSTABLES® SANDWICHES."}